#: ../../talk/call_views.rst:3
msgid "Call layout"
msgstr "Opkaldets layout"

#: ../../talk/call_views.rst:5
msgid ""
"You can switch between grid view and speaker view using the toggle icon in "
"the three-dot menu or the bottom bar."
msgstr ""
"Du kan skifte mellem gittervisning og talervisning med skifteikonet i menuen"
" med de tre prikker eller i bjælken nederst."

#: ../../talk/call_views.rst:11
msgid "Grid view"
msgstr "Gittervisning"

#: ../../talk/call_views.rst:13
msgid ""
"Grid view shows all participants as tiles. Use the navigation buttons on the"
" left and right to scroll through participants when they do not all fit on "
"the screen."
msgstr ""
"Gittervisningen viser alle deltagere som felter. Brug navigationsknapperne "
"til venstre og højre for at bladre, hvis ikke alle deltagere kan være på "
"skærmen."

#: ../../talk/call_views.rst:19
msgid "Speaker view"
msgstr "Talervisning"

#: ../../talk/call_views.rst:21
msgid ""
"Speaker view (also called promoted view) centres the active speaker in a "
"large tile and places the other participants in a row below. Use the "
"navigation buttons on the left and right to scroll through participants when"
" the row overflows."
msgstr ""
"Talervisningen viser den, der taler, i et stort felt i midten og de andre "
"deltagere på en række nedenunder. Brug navigationsknapperne til venstre og "
"højre for at bladre, hvis rækken er for lang."
